🔹 Program 6: Relational Operator Overloading

📌 Description

This program demonstrates relational operator overloading by overloading the ">" operator for a "Distance" class.

Two "Distance" objects are compared using:

"first > second"

The overloaded operator compares their stored meter values.

🎯 Concept Used

Relational Operator Overloading

💡 Key Point

Operators such as ">", "<", "==", and "!=" can be overloaded for user-defined classes.
